return ['domain'=>'zinn-cache','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);','language'=>'uz_UZ','project-id-version'=>'zinn-cache','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-09-08T20:36:54+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-09-08T20:36:54+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Cache'=>'Zinn® Cache','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-cache'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-cache','For sites hosted with Zinn Digital®. Controls the page cache your Zinn® server already provides — smart auto-purge on content change, remote purge from your Zinn® dashboard, a Redis object-cache toggle, safe WordPress/WooCommerce exclusions, and one-click admin login. This is a cache controller, not a cache engine. Hosting elsewhere? Install Zinn® Cache Engine instead.'=>'Zinn Digital® da xosting qilingan saytlar uchun. Zinn® serveringiz allaqachon taqdim etadigan sahifa keshini boshqaradi — kontent o\'zgarganda aqlli avtomatik tozalash, Zinn® boshqaruv panelidan masofadan turib tozalash, Redis ob\'ekt keshini yoqish/o\'chirish tugmasi, xavfsiz WordPress/WooCommerce istisnolari va bir marta bosish bilan administrator sifatida kirish. Bu kesh mexanizmi emas, balki kesh boshqaruvchisidir. Boshqa joyda xostingdan foydalanyapsizmi? Buning o\'rniga Zinn® Cache Engine ni o\'rnating.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','Cache'=>'Kesh','Page cache'=>'Sahifa kesh xotirasi','Object cache'=>'Obyekt keshi','Purging'=>'Tozalanmoqda','Exclusions'=>'Istisnolar','Purge everything now'=>'Hozir hamma narsani tozalash','Every cached page is discarded and will be rebuilt as visitors arrive. Continue?'=>'Keshidlangan har bir sahifa o\'chirib tashlanadi va tashrif buyuruvchilar kelishi bilan qaytadan yaratiladi. Davom etasizmi?','Full-page cache'=>'To\'liq sahifali kesh','Served by LiteSpeed at the web server, before WordPress runs. This is where nearly all the speed comes from.'=>'LiteSpeed veb-serveri tomonidan WordPress ishga tushishidan oldin xizmat ko\'rsatiladi. Deyarli barcha tezlik shu yerdan kelib chiqadi.','Send LiteSpeed cache-control and tag headers on cacheable pages'=>'Keshlanishi mumkin bo\'lgan sahifalarda LiteSpeed cache-control va tag sarlavhalarini yuborish','How long a page stays cached'=>'Sahifa qancha vaqt keshda saqlanishi','Seconds. A week suits most sites; a news site publishing hourly wants far less.'=>'Soniya. Ko\'pchilik saytlar uchun bir hafta yetarli; soatiga yangilik e\'lon qiladigan yangiliklar saytiga esa bundan ancha kam kerak bo\'ladi.','How long a visitor’s browser keeps images and scripts'=>'Tashrif buyuruvchining brauzeri rasmlar va skriptlarni qancha vaqt davomida saqlashi','Seconds. Applies to images, CSS and JavaScript only — never to pages. Set to 0 to leave this to your host.'=>'Soniya. Faqat tasvirlar, CSS va JavaScript uchun amal qiladi — sahifalarga hech qachon. Buni xostingizga qoldirish uchun 0 ga o\'rnating.','Signed-in visitors'=>'Tizimga kirgan tashrif buyuruvchilar','Never serve a cached page to a signed-in visitor'=>'Tizimga kirgan tashrif buyuruvchiga hech qachon keshirilgan sahifani ko‘rsatmang','On is the safe answer and the default. Turn it off only if you know every cached page is identical for every signed-in user — a membership site is the usual reason not to.'=>'"Yoqilgan" xavfsiz javob va standart hisoblanadi. Uni faqat har bir keshga saqlangan sahifa tizimga kirgan har bir foydalanuvchi uchun bir xil ekanligini aniq bilsangizgina o\'chiring — a\'zolik sayti buni qilmaslikning odatiy sababidir.','Different lifetimes for different content'=>'Turli xil kontent uchun har xil yashash muddati','For example: a shop’s product pages for an hour, while everything else stays a week.'=>'Masalan: doʻkonning mahsulot sahifalari bir soatga, qolgan hamma narsa esa bir haftaga qoladi.','Add a rule'=>'Qoida qo\'shish','Content type'=>'Kontent turi','Seconds'=>'Soniya','Object cache (Redis)'=>'Obyekt keshi (Redis)','Caches the results of database queries. It helps most on a busy shop or a site with a lot of signed-in traffic, where the page cache cannot.'=>'Ma\'lumotlar bazasi so\'rovlari natijalarini keshlaydi. Bu sahifa keshi ishlamaydigan gavjum do\'konda yoki ko\'p sonli tizimga kirgan foydalanuvchilarga ega saytda eng ko\'p yordam beradi.','Install the Redis object-cache drop-in'=>'Redis obyekt-kesh plaginini o\'rnating','Needs the phpredis extension. If it is missing, the box above this screen says so.'=>'phpredis kengaytmasini talab qiladi. Agar u yetishmasa, bu ekrandagi yuqoridagi quti bu haqda xabar beradi.','Redis host'=>'Redis host','Redis port'=>'Redis port','Redis database'=>'Redis maʼlumotlar bazasi','Give each site on a shared Redis its own number, or they will clear each other’s cache.'=>'Umumiy Redis’dagi har bir saytga o‘z raqamini bering, aks holda ular bir-birining keshini tozalab yuboradi.','Redis password'=>'Redis paroli','Leave blank if your Redis does not need one.'=>'Agar Redis\'ingiz uchun bu kerak bo\'lmasa, bo\'sh qoldiring.','Key prefix'=>'Kalit prefiksi','An alternative to a separate database number when you cannot have one.'=>'Aloohida ma\'lumotlar bazasi raqami bo\'lmagan holatda uning o\'rnini bosuvchi muqobil variant.','Smart auto-purge'=>'Aqlli avtomatik tozalash','Clear affected pages automatically when content changes'=>'Kontent o\'zgarganda ta\'sirlangan sahifalarni avtomatik tozalash','After updates'=>'Yangilanishlardan keyin','Clear everything after a core, plugin or theme update'=>'Yadro, plagin yoki mavzu yangilanganidan keyin hamma narsani tozalang','After a comment'=>'Izohdan keyin','Clear a post’s page when a comment on it is approved'=>'Unga yozilgan izoh tasdiqlanganda post sahifasini tozalash','Turn this off on a very busy comment section, where it can clear the same page hundreds of times an hour.'=>'Uni juda gavjum izohlar bo‘limida o‘chirib qo‘ying, bu yerda u bir soat ichida yuzlab marta bir xil sahifani tozalashi mumkin.','Never cache these'=>'Bularni hech qachon keshlash mumkin emas','Sensible WordPress and WooCommerce defaults are always applied — cart, checkout, my-account and any signed-in session are never cached, whatever is below.'=>'Har doim oqilona WordPress va WooCommerce standartlari qoʻllaniladi — savat, buyurtma berish, mening hisobim va har qanday kirish seansi nima boʻlishidan qatʼiy nazar hech qachon keshlanmaydi.','Addresses'=>'Manzillar','One path per line, for example <code>/basket</code>. A trailing <code>*</code> matches everything under it.'=>'Har bir qatorda bitta yoʻl, masalan, <code>/basket</code>. Oxiridagi <code>*</code> belgisi uning ostidagi hamma narsaga mos keladi.','Query parameters'=>'So\'rov parametrlari','A page carrying one of these is never cached — for example a one-time preview token.'=>'Ushbu belgiga ega sahifa hech qachon keshlanmaydi — masalan, bir martalik ko‘rib chiqish tokeni.','Cookies'=>'Cookie-fayllar','A visitor carrying one of these is always served a fresh page.'=>'Bulardan birini olib yurgan tashrif buyuruvchiga har doim yangi sahifa taqdim etiladi.','Every cached page has been discarded. They will be rebuilt as visitors arrive.'=>'Keshdagi barcha sahifalar oʻchirib yuborildi. Ular tashrif buyuruvchilar kelishi bilan qayta tiklanadi.','The page cache is on, but this server is not LiteSpeed.'=>'Sahifa keshi yoqilgan, ammo bu server LiteSpeed emas.','The cache headers are being sent and nothing is reading them, so pages are not actually being cached. Ask your host whether LiteSpeed is available, or move to Zinn® hosting where it is standard.'=>'Kesh sarlavhalari yuborilmoqda, lekin ularni hech narsa o\'qimayapti, shuning uchun sahifalar aslida keshlanmayapti. Hosting provayderingizdan LiteSpeed mavjudligini so\'rang yoki uni standart ravishda taklif qiluvchi Zinn® hostingiga o\'ting.','The object cache is on, but this server has no Redis support.'=>'Obyekt keshi yoqilgan, biroq bu serverda Redis qoʻllab-quvvatlanmaydi.','The phpredis extension is not installed, so the drop-in cannot be used and WordPress is falling back to its own in-memory cache. Ask your host to enable phpredis.'=>'phpredis kengaytmasi o\'rnatilmagan, shuning uchun plagin ishlatib bo\'lmaydi va WordPress o\'zining xotiradagi keshiga o\'tmoqda. Xosting provayderingizdan phpredis\'ni yoqishni so\'rang.','Nothing is being cached.'=>'Hech qanday keshlanish amalga oshirilmayapti.','Both caches are switched off, so this plugin is not making the site any faster.'=>'Ikkala kesh ham o\'chirilgan, shuning uchun bu plagin saytni tezlashtirayotgani yo\'q.','Caching is active on this site.'=>'Ushbu saytda keshlash faol.','Web server'=>'Veb-server','LiteSpeed — page caching available'=>'LiteSpeed — sahifani keshlash mavjud','not LiteSpeed — page caching unavailable'=>'LiteSpeed ​​emas — sahifani kesh qilish imkonsiz','Redis support'=>'Redis qo‘llab-quvvatlashi','phpredis is installed'=>'phpredis o\'rnatilgan','phpredis is not installed'=>'phpredis oʻrnatilmagan','Page lifetime'=>'Sahifa amal qilish muddati','You are not allowed to purge the cache.'=>'Sizga keshni tozalashga ruxsat berilmagan.','Cache purge requested.'=>'Keshni tozalash soʻraldi.','Zinn® Cache: another object-cache drop-in is installed, so the Redis object cache is not managed by this plugin.'=>'Zinn® Kesh: boshqa obyekt-kesh plagin o\'rnatilgan, shuning uchun Redis obyekt keshi ushbu plagin tomonidan boshqarilmaydi.','detected'=>'aniqlandi','not detected'=>'aniqlanmadi','phpredis extension missing'=>'phpredis kengaytmasi yoʻq','active'=>'faol','inactive'=>'faol emas','LiteSpeed cache:'=>'LiteSpeed keshi:','Redis object cache:'=>'Redis obyekt keshi:','The Redis PHP extension (phpredis) is not available on this server, so the object cache cannot be enabled.'=>'Redis PHP kengaytmasi (phpredis) bu serverda mavjud emas, shuning uchun obyekt keshini yoqib boʻlmaydi.','Another object-cache drop-in is already installed. Remove it before enabling the Zinn® object cache.'=>'Boshqa object-cache drop-in moduli allaqachon o‘rnatilgan. Zinn® object cache\'ni yoqishdan oldin uni olib tashlang.','Could not write the Redis connection configuration file.'=>'Redis ulanish konfiguratsiya faylini yozib boʻlmadi.','The bundled object-cache drop-in could not be read.'=>'Birlashtirilgan obyekt-kesh drop-in oʻqib boʻlmadi.','Could not install the object-cache drop-in into wp-content.'=>'Obyekt-kesh drop-in wp-content ichiga oʻrnatib boʻlmadi.','Could not remove the object-cache drop-in.'=>'Obyekt-kesh drop-in olib tashlab boʻlmadi.','The WordPress filesystem is not writable, so the object-cache drop-in could not be managed.'=>'WordPress fayl tizimiga yozib boʻlmaydi, shuning uchun obyekt-kesh drop-in boshqarib boʻlmadi.','This one-click login link is not valid any more. Links expire after a couple of minutes and can only be used once — open your site from the Zinn® dashboard again to get a fresh one.'=>'Ushbu bir marta bosish orqali kirish havolasi endi yaroqli emas. Havolalar bir necha daqiqadan so\'ng o\'z kuchini yo\'qotadi va faqat bir marta ishlatilishi mumkin — yangisini olish uchun saytingizni Zinn® boshqaruv panelidan qayta oching.','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'Zinn Digital® chiqarilish eslatmalarini ko\'ring.','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'Yuklab olingan yangilanish yaxlitlik tekshiruvidan o\'ta olmadi va o\'rnatilmadi.','Stored. Type a new value to replace it.'=>'Saqlangan. Uni almashtirish uchun yangi qiymat kiriting.','Filter this list…'=>'Ushbu roʻyxatni filtrlash…','Filter this list'=>'Bu ro\'yxatni filtrlash','Nothing matches that filter.'=>'Bu filtrga hech narsa mos kelmadi.','Add a row'=>'Qator qo\'shish','Remove this row'=>'Ushbu qatorni olib tashlash','Remove'=>'O\'chirish','Zinn Digital®'=>'Zinn Digital®','Zinn Digital® — overview'=>'Zinn Digital® — umumiy ko\'rinish','Overview'=>'Umumiy koʻrinish','Every Zinn® plugin on this site, and whether it is working.'=>'Ushbu saytdagi har bir Zinn® plagin va uning ishlayotgani yoki ishlamayotgani.','No connection is needed for this plugin.'=>'Bu plagin uchun ulanish talab qilinmaydi.','Open settings'=>'Sozlamalarni ochish','You do not have permission to change these settings.'=>'Ushbu sozlamalarni oʻzgartirishga ruxsatingiz yoʻq.','Settings sections'=>'Sozlamalar bo\'limlari','Support'=>'Qo\'llab-quvvatlash','Save changes'=>'O‘zgarishlarni saqlash','Tools'=>'Vositalar','Export settings'=>'Sozlamalarni eksport qilish','Reset to defaults'=>'Standart holatga qaytarish','This puts every setting on this plugin back to its default. Continue?'=>'Bu plagindagi har bir sozlamani standart holatiga qaytaradi. Davom etasizmi?','Diagnostics for support'=>'Qo\'llab-quvvatlash uchun diagnostika','Import a settings file'=>'Sozlamalar faylini import qilish','Import'=>'Import qilish','Exported files never contain passwords, tokens or API keys — you will need to enter those again on the new site.'=>'Eksport qilingan fayllarda hech qachon parollar, tokenlar yoki API kalitlari bo\'lmaydi — ularni yangi saytda qaytadan kiritishingiz kerak bo\'ladi.','Settings saved.'=>'Sozlamalar saqlandi.','Every setting on this plugin is back to its default.'=>'Ushbu plaginning barcha sozlamalari odatiy holatiga qaytarildi.','Done.'=>'Bajarildi.','That action is not available.'=>'Bu amal bajarib bo\'lmaydi.','That file could not be read. Choose a settings file exported from a Zinn® plugin.'=>'Bu faylni o‘qib bo‘lmadi. Zinn® plaginidan eksport qilingan sozlamalar faylini tanlang.','That file is too large to be a settings export.'=>'Bu fayl sozlamalar eksporti uchun juda katta.','That file is not a Zinn® settings export.'=>'Bu fayl Zinn® sozlamalari eksporti emas.','That file was exported from a different plugin (%s), so importing it here would store settings this plugin does not understand.'=>'Bu fayl boshqa plagindan (%s) eksport qilingan, shuning uchun uni bu yerga import qilish ushbu plagin tushunmaydigan sozlamalarni saqlaydi.','%d setting imported. Passwords and API keys are never in an export, so enter those again.'=>'%d ta sozlama import qilindi. Parollar va API kalitlari eksportga kiritilmaydi, shuning uchun ularni qaytadan kiriting.' . "\0" . '%d ta sozlama import qilindi. Parollar va API kalitlari eksportga kiritilmaydi, shuning uchun ularni qaytadan kiriting.','Connected'=>'Ulangan','Connecting…'=>'Ulanmoqda…','Connected, but something needs attention'=>'Uzlangan, lekin e\'tibor talab qiladigan narsa bor','Not connected'=>'Ulanmagan','Running on your own account'=>'O\'z hisobingizdan ishlamoqda','We could not check this'=>'Buni tekshira olmadik','This plugin did not say why. Send a diagnostics report and we will look.'=>'Bu plagin nima sababdan ekanligini ko\'rsatmadi. Diagnostika hisobotini yuboring va biz buni ko\'rib chiqamiz.','Connection status'=>'Ulanish holati','Last checked %s ago.'=>'Oxirgi marta %s oldin tekshirilgan.','(opens in a new tab)'=>'(yangi tabda ochiladi)','Send this to Zinn® support'=>'Zinn® qo‘llab-quvvatlash xizmatiga yuborish','This is exactly what will be sent — nothing else, and nothing hidden. Your passwords, tokens and API keys are not in it.'=>'Yuboriladigan narsa aynan shu — boshqa hech narsa va hech qanday yashirin narsa yo\'q. Parollaringiz, tokenlaringiz va API kalitlaringiz uning ichida emas.','The diagnostics report that will be sent'=>'Yuboriladigan diagnostika hisoboti','Copy to clipboard'=>'Bunker nusxalash','Send this report to Zinn® support'=>'Ushbu hisobotni Zinn® qo\'llab-quvvatlash xizmatiga yuboring','We open a support ticket for you and reply by email. If you would rather not send it, copy it above and paste it into a ticket yourself.'=>'Biz siz uchun yordam so\'rovini ochamiz va elektron pochta orqali javob beramiz. Agar buni yuborishni xohlamasangiz, uni yuqoridan nusxalab oling va o\'zingiz so\'rovga joylashtiring.','Copied'=>'Nusxa olindi','We could not reach Zinn Digital® from this server (%s). Copy the report above and open a ticket instead — nothing about your settings is wrong.'=>'Ushbu serverdan (%s) Zinn Digital® bilan bog‘lanib bo‘lmadi. Yuqoridagi hisobotni nusxalab oling va uning o‘rniga murojaat oching — sozlamalaringizda hech qanday xato yo‘q.','Sent. Zinn® support has your report and will reply by email.'=>'Zinn® qo‘llab-quvvatlash xizmati xabaringizni qabul qildi va elektron pochta orqali javob beradi.','Sent. Zinn® support has your report — reference %s — and will reply by email.'=>'Zinn® qo‘llab-quvvatlash xizmati xabaringizni qabul qildi — maʼlumot raqami %s — va elektron pochta orqali javob beradi.','You have sent several reports in a short time. Wait a few minutes and try again — the earlier ones did arrive.'=>'Qisqa vaqt ichida bir nechta hisobot yubordingiz. Bir necha daqiqa kutib, qayta urinib ko\'ring — avvalgilari yetib kelgan.','Zinn Digital® could not accept the report just now — that is our end, not yours. Try again shortly, or copy the report above into a ticket.'=>'Zinn Digital® hozircha hisobotni qabul qila olmadi — bu bizning tomonda, siz tomonda emas. Qisqa vaqtdan keyin yana urinib ko‘ring yoki yuqoridagi hisobotni tiketga nusxalang.','The report was refused (HTTP %d). Copy it above and open a ticket, quoting that number.'=>'Hisobot rad etildi (HTTP %d). Uni yuqoridan nusxalab oling va shu raqamni keltirgan holda murojaat oching.','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — qo\'llanmalar va xizmatlar','User guides'=>'Foydalanuvchi qoʻllanmalari','Read the %s user guide'=>'%s foydalanuvchi qo\'llanmasini o\'qing','Hide this'=>'Buni yashirish','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'WordPress uchun Zinn® xostingi','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed, kunlik zaxira nusxalari, bepul migratsiya va birdan ortiq sayt yuritadiganlar uchun mo‘ljallangan boshqaruv paneli.','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Zinn® bozori','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'Tayyor saytlar, domenlar va havola joylashtirishni xarid qiling va soting, mablag\' esa har ikki tomon rozi bo\'lgunga qadar xavfsiz saqlanadi.','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — buni kasb qilgan mutaxassislarni yollang','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'Bizning global frilanserlar bozori: matn yozuvchilar, dizaynerlar, dasturchilar va SEO mutaxassislarining 10 000 dan ortiq tayyor xizmatlarini ko\'rib chiqing yoki loyiha joylashtirib, ularga taklif kiritish imkonini bering.','Style preset'=>'Uslub sozlamasi','A starting point. Anything below overrides it.'=>'Boshlang\'ich nuqta. Undan pastdagi har qanday narsa buni bekor qiladi.','Use my own colours and sizes'=>'O\'z ranglarim va o\'lchamlarimdan foydalanish','Leave this off and the preset is used exactly as it is.'=>'Buni o\'chirib qo\'ying va andoza o\'z holicha ishlatiladi.']];